      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Introduction -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Overview</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
          Prax provides comprehensive security features including Row-Level Security (RLS),
